    {
      "text": "make of thee a great nation, Gen. 12:2. I will make thy seed as the dust of the earth, Gen. 13:16. I will make nations of thee, and kings shall come out, Gen. 17:6. Let people serve thee, and nations bow down to thee, Gen. 27:29. in thy seed shall all the families of the earth be blessed, Gen. 28:14. company of nations shall be of thee, Gen. 35:11. father laid his right hand upon the head of Ephraim, Gen. 48:17. twelve tribes … every one according to his blessing, Gen. 49:28. keep my covenant, then ye shall be a peculiar treasure unto me, Ex. 19:5. I … will be your God, and ye shall be my people, Lev. 26:12. Lord … hath chosen thee to be a special people, Deut. 7:6. holy people unto the Lord thy God, Deut. 26:19. blessings shall come … if thou shalt hearken, Deut. 28:2. desert shall rejoice, and blossom as the rose, Isa. 35:1. give thee for a light to the Gentiles, Isa. 49:6. so shall your seed and your name remain, Isa. 66:22. shall be showers of blessing, Ezek. 34:26. as ye were a curse … ye shall be a blessing, Zech. 8:13. windows of heaven, and pour you out a blessing, Mal. 3:10 (3 Ne. 24:10).",
